WEBVTT

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.870
So you see,

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:25.830
if we can show them that
we have love in our hearts,

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:30.830
neither animals nor demon beasts
will try to harm us.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.160
Oww...

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:34.370
Damn those demon beasts.

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:35.750
They really got you, huh?

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:36.700
You okay?

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.500
Yeah. I'll make them pay for this.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.040
Demon beasts must be slain!

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.950
Don't you agree, Shigure?

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:47.370
Yes... You've told me about this
many times, actually.

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:48.790
It's important!

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:53.160
Damn. The eastern guilds
took heavy damage, too.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.700
It's kill or be killed with
these demon beasts, huh?

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.450
They can understand how we feel, you see.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:00.540
They got us again!

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:01.580
Honey!

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.500
Daddy!

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.500
Father!

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.000
We'll get them for this!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.870
Love! It's all about love!

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:11.250
We'll fill this world with love for animals!

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:13.950
Kill all the demon beasts!

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:16.290
And I've got just the way!

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:18.160
What is it?

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:20.620
I'm going to open a pet shop.

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.700
That sounds great!

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:24.700
But what's a pet shop?

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.580
I have to start there?

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:02.000
"Quest x Demon Beast Killer"

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.500
Keeping demon beasts in your homes?

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.950
Is that possible?

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:10.330
Shigure, were you listening to me?

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:13.330
I'm going to raise demon beasts
so they can live with humans

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:16.290
and become a bridge
between them and humanity.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:19.080
And that's the job of a pet shop.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:22.750
But it's not a charity.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:26.040
We'll be raising the demon beasts
and then taking money

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.080
from the people we give them to.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.450
So we'll be taking quests from the guild,

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:32.870
capturing demon beasts
and taking the reward for that,

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:35.620
and then training the demon beasts,

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:38.950
then selling them to customers
for lots of money!

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:41.910
So you get twice the money, huh?

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:44.040
Exciting, isn't it?

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:46.040
Being surrounded by demon beasts!

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:49.000
Getting all that money!

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:55.000
All right, I'm in! Let me help
with your "pet shop" thing!

00:03:55.870 --> 00:04:01.580
But first, I need a place to live
and a place to keep the demon beasts.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:04.910
And that means I need money.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:07.450
Um, well...

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:12.410
I need to pay back Edgar...

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:17.870
I'd like to form a party with you...

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:20.160
Of course!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.620
Of course you can, Shigure!

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.410
Um...

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.830
What part of me were you looking at
when you made that decision?

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.700
So we can choose from this list?

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:34.790
Yes.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:36.950
What's that?

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:40.000
That contains information on the demon beasts,

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.080
to help you defeat them.

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:46.200
But you won't need it, demon beast killer!

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:49.830
What did you just call me?

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:51.660
Everybody's talking about you.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:55.450
You took down five cerberuses
in a single instant.

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:57.870
Now everybody's calling you...

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.830
...the demon beast killer!

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.950
Who are you calling a demon beast killer?

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:12.250
What the hell kind of name is that
to give an animal wrestler?

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.000
But this looks useful!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:18.870
Now, I'd like a match
with a high payout, but...

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:20.580
...I can't read this.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.160
But it's our first quest,

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:28.000
so shouldn't we avoid anything hard
and try something simpler?

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.450
But I want money fast.

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:32.870
Which one pays the most?

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.790
This one, I guess.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:37.290
"Defeat the Salamander," it says.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:41.080
Sure, we'll go with that.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.450
Were you listening to me?

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:47.500
It's our first time, so we should
pick something easy.

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:49.040
Listen to me, Shigure.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:50.790
Whenever I'm prepping for a match,

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.750
I always emphasize
the mental aspect of battle.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.450
If you're always running,
running becomes a habit.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:59.290
I've seen wrestlers where that's happened.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:02.450
I don't follow...

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:06.290
So, which one of these is a salamander?

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:09.540
This one. A giant, fire-breathing lizard.

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:10.950
This is...

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.910
Genzo, your face! Your face!

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:16.750
Sorry, I couldn't help it...

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.950
I'm going to need to learn to read, though.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:22.370
A salamander, huh?

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:24.910
That's gonna be a tough one.

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:27.660
Hey, that's Heat Haze.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:30.330
The strongest man in the guild,
and the demon beast ki--

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:32.450
Stop it! Don't say that name!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.000
You seem like a newbie hunter.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.870
No, I'm a pro wrestler.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:43.910
Want to join up with our party?

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:47.370
We can split the reward if we succeed.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:49.910
Really? That's great!

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:52.950
Well, it's to celebrate your first victory.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:07:00.000
Don't worry. I'll kill the salamander
with a single stab of my sword!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.330
You're going to kill an animal, huh?

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:06.700
Leader!

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:08.000
Are you okay?

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.410
Hey, wake up...

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.000
Never say something so stupid again.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.620
Did Heat Haze just say something stupid?

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:17.750
I don't know...

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.120
Shigure, let's go.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:20.750
Okay!

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:28.750
Look! Somebody forget their sword!

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:30.700
Well, it's mine now!

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:33.410
That was Heat Haze's, right?

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:36.160
Yeah, that was definitely Heat Haze's.

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:46.620
Look, Shigure!

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:49.290
It's alive! It's moving!

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:50.700
Hot! Hot!

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.950
Whew! These flames are your love, huh?

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:56.000
It's okay. You're so cute, huh?

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.330
Yoshiko!

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.200
He gave it a name?

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.330
Yoshiko is mine now.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.040
Yoshiko?

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:07.660
The salamander.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:14.580
A salamander for your first quest, huh?

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:18.080
I'd heard the rumors, but I can see why
they call you the demon beast killer.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:22.290
I keep telling people not to call me that!

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:24.000
We got quite a lot of money, huh?

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.910
Now let's go.

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.700
Go where?

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:34.500
Bro, I'm bored.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:37.870
Want to go wander around the town
and do something bad?

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.200
Good idea.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:46.790
No... not today.

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:53.410
Don't tell me he still
can't forget that pervert...

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:54.660
Hello!

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:00.000
Wh-What do you want?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.200
Um... is Edgar in?

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.870
Not right now.

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:07.040
I wanted to make this month's payment...

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:08.620
Put it there.

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:11.160
I'll make sure Edgar gets it.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:28.410
This looks delicious!

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:31.790
Mistress, it's time for dinner.

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:44.870
The same as always: orc meat,
goblin meat, troll meat...

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:51.790
I'm sick of all this nasty meat!

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:59.200
I want to go out into the wider world
and eat all kinds of yummy foods!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:03.830
Foods! Foods! Foods!

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.160
Our next targets are soldier monkeys.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.120
It said there were a lot of them.

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:13.080
Genzo, do you have a plan?

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.250
Let me think...

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:17.120
I bet they've got nice butts!

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:21.330
I didn't ask if you thought they were cute...

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:24.500
I wonder how many there are...

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:25.950
I can't wait to meet them!

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:27.700
Forget it.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:30.410
I think it's about time...

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:31.370
Look.

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:34.250
There's so many!

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:36.080
Okay! This is great!

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:38.120
It is not great!

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:41.160
The soldier monkeys look really mad!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.580
Don't worry!

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.500
Just wait...

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:49.500
Come on, guys!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.750
Don't come on!

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:05.580
It's an apple.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:16.750
An apple.

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:23.120
Glance.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:30.700
Now they're all best friends...

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.500
Wow.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:36.000
It's love. Love, Shigure.

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:39.500
It's a talent, kind of.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:46.790
So, we've got quite a lot of them now.

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:49.200
Is this okay?

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.950
My dream is coming true!

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.540
I'm so happy...

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.250
Genzo.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:07.870
How are you guys so cute?

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:07.870
Genzo!

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:09.750
Genzo!

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.620
Genzo, are you awake?

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:16.540
Oh, Shigure.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.290
I had the nicest dream.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:21.500
In the dream I was surrounded
by demon beasts...

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:23.290
It was so great.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:27.160
That's not much different
than reality, I don't think.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:29.330
And look at them all...

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:33.370
If somebody finds all these demon beasts
you'll be in trouble.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:34.450
You're right!

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:36.580
What if somebody stole them?!

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:39.790
No, I don't think you need
to worry about that.

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:42.660
Either way, we need to do
something about them.

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.830
We need to find a place for them to live.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:47.250
And for us to live, too!

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:48.790
Oh, yeah.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:53.750
But we'll need a decent amount
of money to get a house.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.250
So we need a big quest, huh?

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:02.950
Which of these pays the most?

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:04.080
This one.

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:05.160
Fighting orcs.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:09.870
They want you to deal with the orcs
that are stealing their crops.

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:11.000
Orcs?

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.200
Look.

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:13.410
What?

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:20.120
Huh? You're much less excited than usual.

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.200
This guy's not an animal, though.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.910
Is that a problem?

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:25.950
But they can understand speech, you know?

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.620
Then they're basically human.

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:29.620
An orc's an orc!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:33.620
There's some with nice hair and big fangs, too.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:37.250
Huh? You're much more excited
than usual, Shigure.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:40.200
It pays a ton!

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:41.330
If we can pull this off

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:43.620
we can get a house for you
to live with your demon beasts!

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:46.290
What? Then that changes things.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:47.540
Let's do it.

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.790
Now it's orcs, I guess.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:52.290
You can't handle orcs solo.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:55.080
No, maybe he can.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.910
What? The mistress is gone?

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:02.870
Yes...

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:06.620
I'll bring her back.

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:11.250
And if anybody tries to stop me,
I'll kill them...

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.200
Want to take a break at the lake up ahead?

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:23.450
Yeah...

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:29.370
I don't want to walk all night
and get there exhausted for the fight.

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:32.700
You're really spoiling for a fight today, huh?

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:37.120
To me, orcs and demon beasts
are in the same category, though.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:39.450
They're totally different!

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:43.870
But I guess it's easier
since we can talk to the orcs.

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:47.290
You don't get it, Shigure.

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:50.660
Sometimes words can get in the way.

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:07.950
Really, sometimes I don't know
what Genzo's talking about at all.

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:12.000
But the fact that he doesn't discriminate
against beast people makes him great--

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:17.120
Genzo, you per--

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:25.500
Look at you... Look at you...

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:31.620
Mami!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:36.450
You're so pretty!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:38.870
Aww, you're the best!

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:43.200
Somehow this makes me just as mad...

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:43.200
Aww, you're the best!

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:50.450
I smell something.

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:51.830
That.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:01.080
You stay out of this.

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:02.910
First, I'll talk to them.

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:07.290
No, just because you can talk to them
doesn't mean they'll understand...

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:15.620
Okay!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.660
Come on out, damn it!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.620
Who are you?

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.500
You wanna fight?

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:27.660
Wasn't he going to talk to them?

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:33.500
Whoever's the strongest of you, come on out!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.580
What?

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:43.410
Did somebody call me--

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:48.700
It's not you, is it?

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:54.950
I'm the one in charge here.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:58.910
What do you want, human?

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:03.080
I heard you're stealing crops
from the villagers.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:06.330
What of it?

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:11.450
I don't think that's got anything
to do with you.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:15.250
I'd thought I could try
resolving this peacefully.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:26.160
The gong's been rung!

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:31.700
I don't understand what that means...

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.580
But... that was a good kick.

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.830
An animal drop kick.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:45.950
Remember that name.

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:48.330
I don't know what that is,

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:52.950
but it seems you've really made me mad.

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:54.870
Bring it!

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:04.370
Okay, got him!

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:05.200
Fool!

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:07.580
He took a punch from the king!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.580
Okay!

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:12.040
That was a good punch from you, too.

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:14.910
You could star in a main event!

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:17.410
Who are you?

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:21.250
I am a pro wrestler!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.370
Genzo...

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:54.330
Yes!

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:24.410
Get 'em!

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:30.250
Heck yeah!

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:37.000
The king has made the pose of submission!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:39.580
A new king is born!

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:43.500
A new king?

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:48.200
I don't understand... but Genzo won, right?

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:57.200
You're amazing.

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:59.660
I'm impressed.

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:01.620
It was a good match.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:11.250
Okay, I'm leaving the king in charge here.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:13.410
Everybody, do what he says.

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:15.910
Yeah!

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:21.290
Weren't you going to talk things out?

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:24.620
I did! We talked with our fists!

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:26.790
Is that what you meant?

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:29.250
Is Mami okay, you think?

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.580
Who's Mami?

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:35.580
The unicorn we met in the lake!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:39.080
I'm so worried she's run off!

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:41.410
Shigure, let's hurry!

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:44.120
Wait up a second.

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:48.040
What? You brought the orcs to heel?

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:52.580
Do you know how many strong
hunters have fallen to them?

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:55.330
So, how'd you do it?

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:57.120
They talked with their fists!

00:20:57.120 --> 00:21:01.250
Amazing, demon beast killer!

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:04.540
I told you not to call me that!

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.830
I see.

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:14.830
So, did you buy a store?

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:17.330
Yes, of course.

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:21.700
With the money from the guild's quest,
we were able to get it.

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:25.200
It's even got a barn!

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:30.370
Now you want a loan for funds to pay
the government to open a business.

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:31.450
Indeed.

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:34.120
If you want a loan for the full
amount that you need,

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:39.120
you'll need to have at least 20% of
the amount in hand before we can accept.

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:41.370
Twenty percent?

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:46.580
So much?

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:49.410
We don't have anywhere near that much!

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:53.660
Also, I had a question.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.870
What is a pet shop, even?

00:21:56.870 --> 00:21:58.830
You don't know either?

00:23:46.200 --> 00:23:49.950
Next time: "Runaway Girl x Attack."
